trmap -J --self added each transcript's own gene name without checking it
has one, and compared it as a string, so a GTF with gene_id but no gene_name
crashed it. It now falls back to the gene ID, as for the reference
transcripts.

diff --git a/trmap.cpp b/trmap.cpp
